From a95f345e023e564b9208de872fb1b12a24c20ba5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:39:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add ignore_mask option

Port upstream pixelmatch v8's ignoreMask (mapbox/pixelmatch#171):
pixels whose mask value is non-zero are skipped from the comparison and
drawn as unchanged in the diff output, and differences that fall only
inside the mask take the identical-images fast path.

pixelmatch.core accepts one value per pixel; pixelmatch.contrib.PIL
also accepts a PIL.Image of the same size, converted to grayscale.

Closes #256
